---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Mithra" description="Learn how Mithra Technologies collects, uses, and protects your personal data.">
  <Navigation />

  <!-- Dark header -->
  <section class="pt-24 pb-12 bg-ibm-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-8xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8">
      <p class="text-ibm-blue text-sm font-medium tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-light text-white mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-ibm-gray-40 text-sm">Last updated: May 27, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-8xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">

        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Mithra Technologies S.A. de C.V. ("Mithra," "we," "us," or "our") is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, why we collect it, how we use and share it, and the choices available to you. It applies to all users of our enterprise AI platform and associated services.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          By accessing or using our services, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this policy. If you are using Mithra on behalf of an organization, you represent that you have authority to bind that organization to these terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">1. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We collect information in three main categories:
        </p>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Account Information.</strong> When you create or manage an account, we collect your name, corporate email address, job title, company name, billing address, and payment method details (processed via a PCI-compliant third-party processor — we never store raw card numbers).</p>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Usage Data.</strong> We automatically collect information about how you interact with our platform, including features used, queries submitted, API call logs, error reports, and session duration. This data is pseudonymized at the point of collection.</p>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Device and Technical Information.</strong> We collect IP addresses, browser type and version, operating system, device identifiers, and time zone. This information is used for security, fraud prevention, and service optimization.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">We use the data we collect for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ibm-gray-70 mb-4">
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Service delivery:</strong> Provisioning and operating your account, processing transactions, and providing customer support.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Analytics and product improvement:</strong> Understanding how customers use Mithra to improve performance, reliability, and feature design. Analytics are aggregated and do not identify individual users in reports.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Communications:</strong> Sending service notifications, security alerts, product updates, and — where you have opted in — marketing materials. You may unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Security and compliance:</strong> Detecting and preventing fraud, abuse, and unauthorized access; meeting our legal obligations under applicable law.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We do not use client-submitted data to train or improve our AI models without explicit written consent.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">3. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">We do not sell your personal data.</strong> We share information only in the following circumstances:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ibm-gray-70 mb-4">
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Service providers:</strong> Carefully vetted vendors who process data on our behalf (cloud infrastructure, payment processors, monitoring tools). Each provider is bound by a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) that limits their use of your data to the services they provide to us.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Legal requirements:</strong> When required by law, court order, or governmental authority, or when necessary to protect the rights, property, or safety of Mithra, our users, or the public.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Business transfers:</strong> In connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your data may be transferred as part of that transaction. We will notify you via email and/or prominent notice on our website before your data is subject to a different privacy policy.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We retain your personal data for as long as your account is active. After account closure or contract termination, we retain data for 90 days to allow for account recovery and to fulfill any outstanding legal or contractual obligations. After that period, data is securely deleted or irreversibly anonymized.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Certain data may be retained longer where required by law (for example, financial records required under Mexican tax regulations).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ibm-gray-70 mb-4">
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Correction:</strong> Request that we correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Deletion:</strong> Request erasure of your personal data, subject to retention obligations.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Portability:</strong> Receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ibm-gray-100">Objection:</strong> Object to processing based on legitimate interests or for direct marketing purposes.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          To exercise any of these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@mithra.ai" class="text-ibm-blue hover:underline">privacy@mithra.ai</a>. We will respond within 30 days. We may need to verify your identity before processing requests.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">6. Security Measures</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We implement technical and organizational measures designed to protect your data against unauthorized access, loss, or disclosure. These include:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ibm-gray-70 mb-4">
          <li>Encryption of data at rest (AES-256) and in transit (TLS 1.3).</li>
          <li>SOC 2 Type II certification, audited annually by an independent third party.</li>
          <li>Role-based access controls and mandatory multi-factor authentication for all internal systems.</li>
          <li>Regular penetration testing and vulnerability assessments.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          No method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your data, we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ibm-gray-100 mt-10 mb-4">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-ibm-gray-70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          For privacy-related inquiries, requests, or complaints, contact our Privacy Team:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-ibm-gray-70 mb-4">
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@mithra.ai" class="text-ibm-blue hover:underline">privacy@mithra.ai</a></li>
          <li>Mail: Mithra Technologies S.A. de C.V., Paseo de la Reforma 250, Mexico City, Mexico</li>
        </ul>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
